{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.poster.avif?t=1774024644\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.webm?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.mp4?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.poster.avif?t=1774024644\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.webm?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.mp4?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422840?t=1774024644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774024644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/9f7c6a2573880ad9eae3e30c5ead0d2e3f336919/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774024644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/9f7c6a2573880ad9eae3e30c5ead0d2e3f336919/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774024644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features violent scenes, blood, dead people, and brutality."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3759110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.poster.avif?t=1774024644\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.webm?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.mp4?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.poster.avif?t=1774024644\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.webm?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.mp4?t=1774024644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Antelus Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/9e5b4a12ee8b0032ea3c945c582ecdb59f1a843b/header.jpg?t=1774024644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422840/566125184/52556e78d84fb425fcd27f9ba074b160fa816a3b/1755077100/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755162195","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422840/566125184/52556e78d84fb425fcd27f9ba074b160fa816a3b/1755077100/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755162195","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422840/566125184/52556e78d84fb425fcd27f9ba074b160fa816a3b/1755077100/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755162195","id":257182524,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182524/13df2f122b9b3ddd75eae8adfad83da74a39cfc0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755162195"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422840/856948/bd2e2aeac13668a3b67c8aa9f91c90e82bbe3303/1750849469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755081613","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422840/856948/bd2e2aeac13668a3b67c8aa9f91c90e82bbe3303/1750849469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755081613","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama